Tile 7.4: Pod restart increases

Restarts during the selected period only, ranked highest first. Set the tile timeframe to Last 24 hours.

timeseries r = sum(dt.kubernetes.container.restarts),
           by:{k8s.cluster.name, k8s.namespace.name, k8s.workload.name}
| filter startsWith(k8s.namespace.name, "app")
| fieldsAdd apmid = upper(substring(k8s.namespace.name, from:0, to:11)),
            restarts = arraySum(r)
| filter in(apmid, array($ClaimsApps)) and restarts >= 10
| fieldsAdd status = if(restarts >= 50, "🔴 Critical", else: "🟠 Warning"),
            rank   = if(restarts >= 50, 1, else: 2)
| fieldsAdd appWorkload = concat(apmid, " | ", k8s.namespace.name, " : ", k8s.workload.name)
| fields status, appWorkload, cluster = k8s.cluster.name, restarts = round(restarts, decimals:0), rank
| sort rank asc, restarts desc
| fieldsRemove rank

Tile 7.5: OOMKilled workloads

Workloads killed for exceeding their memory limit. Set the tile timeframe to Last 24 hours.

timeseries o = sum(dt.kubernetes.container.oom_kills),
           by:{k8s.cluster.name, k8s.namespace.name, k8s.workload.name}
| filter startsWith(k8s.namespace.name, "app")
| fieldsAdd apmid = upper(substring(k8s.namespace.name, from:0, to:11)),
            oomKills = arraySum(o)
| filter in(apmid, array($ClaimsApps)) and oomKills > 0
| fieldsAdd status = if(oomKills >= 10, "🔴 Critical", else: "🟠 Warning"),
            rank   = if(oomKills >= 10, 1, else: 2)
| fieldsAdd appWorkload = concat(apmid, " | ", k8s.namespace.name, " : ", k8s.workload.name)
| fields status, appWorkload, cluster = k8s.cluster.name, oomKills = round(oomKills, decimals:0), rank
| sort rank asc, oomKills desc
| fieldsRemove rank
